B. frappe.call filters kwargs only — positional args pass through
========================================================================
def call(fn: str | Callable, *args, **kwargs):
	"""Call a function and match arguments."""
	if isinstance(fn, str):
		fn = get_attr(fn)

	newargs = get_newargs(fn, kwargs)

	return fn(*args, **newargs)
kwargs sent : ['as_dict', 'ignore_user_permissions', 'link_fieldname', 'reference_doctype']
kwargs kept : ['ignore_user_permissions', 'link_fieldname', 'reference_doctype']  <- 'as_dict' has nowhere to go
=> the six positional slots are never re-bound by name; the shift is permanent.

